\text{Var}[Y]=6.$ Find $\\text{Var}[\\frac{3}{8}X+\\frac{1}{2}Y].$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541084 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "59606949-3c87-521e-a2c2-60c040472354" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541084 #edb/ref 1074 "Recall that if $X$ and $Y$ are independent variables, and $a$ and $b$ are constants, then \n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[aX+bY]={a}^{2}\\text{Var}[X]+{b}^{2}\\text{Var}[Y].\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given data into the formula above, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[\\frac{3}{8}X+\\frac{1}{2}Y]={(\\frac{3}{8})}^{2}\\cdot 16+{(\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}\\cdot 6=\\frac{15}{4}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541101 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186540983 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541101 #edb/ref 1069 "q-81246" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541101 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541101 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $C$ and $D$ are finite, non-overlapping regions and that\n\n$$\n{∬}_{C}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A=-7,\\,{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A=19,\n$$\n\nfind the value of \n\n$$\n{∬}_{C\\cup D}2f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541101 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "7534ff45-14c3-5354-a5be-41324d6a8d58" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541101 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the linearity and additivity of double integrals, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{C\\cup D}2f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A & =2{∬}_{C\\cup D}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A \\\\  & =2({∬}_{C}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A+{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A) \\\\  & =2(-7+19) \\\\  & =24\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541155 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186541224 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541155 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0227aae6-d172-57f4-83e8-b1350d2428e9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541155 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186157605 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541167 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2a278359-e48b-574c-8558-aec54e3db4bf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186541167 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186380894 #